# CODEOWNERS — auto-request reviewers for sensitive paths.
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern with the highest precedence
# (https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners).
# Order is intentional: most-specific paths appear LAST so they win for files
# matched by multiple patterns. There is deliberately no global `* @owner`
# fallback — CODEOWNERS exists to surface high-stakes paths, not to gate every
# PR on owner review.

# Project decisions — single source of truth for Key Decisions.
/PROJECT.md @imulab

# Generator core — must be reviewed by repo owner.
/gen/ @imulab

# Runtime support library core — must be reviewed by repo owner.
/rt/ @imulab

# CI / repo-meta — must be reviewed by repo owner.
/.github/ @imulab

# Architecture rules — most sensitive; appears LAST so it has highest precedence.
/CONTRIBUTING.md @imulab
